WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.578
A new job.

00:00:01.578 --> 00:00:02.856
A new place.

00:00:02.856 --> 00:00:04.480
A clearer way forward.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.558
With Workify, follow your next opportunity from the first search
to your first day.

00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:13.370
Start by creating your free worker account.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:18.605
Enter your name and email, choose a password, then set your
country and language.

00:00:18.605 --> 00:00:23.127
In your profile, add your trade, experience, and the languages you
speak.

00:00:23.127 --> 00:00:25.513
Upload your CV and relevant documents.

00:00:25.513 --> 00:00:28.611
You choose what to share with each application.

00:00:29.681 --> 00:00:32.429
Now explore jobs by trade and destination.

00:00:32.429 --> 00:00:35.533
Open a listing and look beyond the salary.

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:37.924
Is the pay net or gross?

00:00:37.924 --> 00:00:40.315
How many hours will you work?

00:00:40.315 --> 00:00:43.776
Is accommodation included, and who pays the travel costs?

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:47.951
Compare the details before deciding which opportunity is right for
you.

00:00:49.021 --> 00:00:52.075
When you find a suitable role, select Apply.

00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:57.691
Choose the documents you want the company to see, and add a short
message about your

00:00:57.691 --> 00:00:58.989
experience and availability.

00:00:58.989 --> 00:01:01.692
Review your details, then send your application.

00:01:01.692 --> 00:01:05.097
Your dashboard brings your applications and next steps together.

00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:09.513
Use messages to ask questions and clarify the offer.

00:01:09.513 --> 00:01:13.894
When an interview is arranged, check the date, time, and time
zone.

00:01:13.894 --> 00:01:17.930
Prepare a few questions, and be ready to explain your experience.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:23.000
Keep important details in your application conversation, so you
can return to them later.

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:26.657
Before accepting, read the contract carefully.

00:01:26.657 --> 00:01:31.290
Compare it with the original listing: salary, working hours,
accommodation, and any

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:31.947
deductions.

00:01:31.947 --> 00:01:36.464
Ask about anything that is unclear, and keep a signed copy.

00:01:36.464 --> 00:01:40.982
A clear agreement now helps you arrive knowing what to expect.

00:01:42.052 --> 00:01:44.174
Follow progress in your application.

00:01:44.174 --> 00:01:49.646
Your agency adds updates and supporting documents for the visa or
work permit process.

00:01:49.646 --> 00:01:54.485
These updates are supplied by the agency; they are not independent
confirmation from

00:01:54.485 --> 00:01:55.490
government systems.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:00.218
Dates are estimates, so confirm the required approvals before
booking your journey.

00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:04.334
Before you travel, work through your checklist.

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:08.567
Confirm your documents, accommodation, arrival contact, and first
working day.

00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:11.217
Save copies of the important information.

00:02:11.217 --> 00:02:16.241
When you arrive, meet your team and follow the workplace safety
instructions.

00:02:17.311 --> 00:02:22.198
Once you start, keep a record of your hours and check your first
salary against your

00:02:22.198 --> 00:02:22.717
contract.

00:02:22.717 --> 00:02:24.152
Raise any concerns early.

00:02:24.152 --> 00:02:25.893
Workify is free for workers.

00:02:25.893 --> 00:02:30.383
If someone asks you to pay to get a job through Workify, report
it.

00:02:31.453 --> 00:02:34.082
Your skills deserve the right opportunity.

00:02:34.082 --> 00:02:39.457
Create your profile, explore the possibilities, and take your next
step with Workify.
